const frRoutes=[
 ['universite-paris-saclay-mathematics-and-applications-fundamental-mathematics','https://www.universite-paris-saclay.fr/en/education/masters-degree/mathematics-and-applications/m1-mathematiques-fondamentales-et-applications','M1 applicants need an L3 fundamental-mathematics qualification or assessed equivalent; the dossier lists CV, motivation, identity and transcripts. The linked page gives 60 M1 places for this route, not university-wide admissions or a probability of acceptance.','The reviewed M1 page gives Inception applications January 15–March 16, 2026 for the 2026 course start. This is historical. The applicable 2027 M1/M2 portal and dates have not been published on that page; do not use the M2 AAG scholarship calendar for every M1 route.'],
 ['sorbonne-universite-mathematics-and-applications-fundamental-mathematics','https://sciences.sorbonne-universite.fr/formation-sciences/offre-de-formation/masters/master-mathematiques-et-applications-offre-2026-2027','M1 dossier review normally follows a mathematics licence; M2 selection assesses prior M1-level mathematics and track fit. The fundamental M2 and agrégation M2 are different tracks. The page explicitly says recommendation letters are not taken into account.','The 2026/27 curriculum page still contains an explicitly 2025 M1 calendar and an M2 March–June paragraph with no consistent intake year. The 2027 application dates are therefore unresolved, not inferred; consult the specific current campaign/portal.'],
 ['universite-psl-mathematics-and-applications','https://www.psl.eu/programmes-gradues/mathematiques-et-applications','PSL graduate mathematics includes research-oriented master and doctoral training through participating schools. The current official indexed programme confirms the route, but exact degree-entry examination, interview and language evidence depend on the school/track; the full page rejected automated retrieval.','The reviewed graduate programme advertises a 2026/27 master bursary call, not a confirmed 2027/28 master admission calendar. ENS/Dauphine track admission and scholarship nomination are separate; exact next admission windows remain unverified.'],
 ['universite-paris-cite-fundamental-mathematics','https://master.math.u-paris.fr/parcours/math/','M1 fundamental/applied mathematics requires L3-level mathematics; M2 fundamental mathematics requires M1-level preparation. Admission is not a universal doctoral supervisor agreement or GRE rule. Certificate/degree equivalence and any language evidence are determined by the actual application route.','The department directs eligible M1 applicants to Mon Master and M2/other categories to e-candidat; the reviewed instructions have no verified 2027 campaign dates. The central Mon Master calendar still refers to 2026.'],
 ['universite-de-rennes-fundamental-mathematics','https://math.univ-rennes.fr/master-parcours-mathematiques-fondamentales','The fundamental pathway prepares for research in algebra, analysis, geometry and probability/statistics. M1 entry uses the qualifying undergraduate mathematics record; M2 is a separate dossier stage. Detailed current language-test/interview conditions were not established from the reviewed official text.','M1 uses Mon Master when applicable. The specific M2 page gives February 7–May 7, 2026 and a later July–August 2026 round; these are historical. International applicants must check the Études en France route and their local calendar; no 2027 date is projected.'],
 ['universite-grenoble-alpes-fundamental-mathematics','https://formations.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/fr/catalogue-2021/master-XB/master-mathematiques-et-applications-IAQKA8QE/parcours-mathematiques-fondamentales-IB9H0I5O.html','M1 requires a compatible bachelor/licence; M2 requires a compatible completed M1 or assessed equivalent. Dossier and/or interview selection may apply. This is the fundamental-mathematics track, not every UGA scholarship-eligible master.','UGA specifies that the application procedure depends on degree sought, qualifications and residence. The programme page links 2026/27 regulations but does not establish a 2027 admission calendar; the 2026/27 IDEX call must not be reused as an admission deadline.'],
 ['universite-claude-bernard-lyon-1-general-mathematics-research-route','https://offre-de-formations.univ-lyon1.fr/parcours-343/m2-mathematiques-generales.html','Correction: the linked Mathématiques générales M2 prepares for the external agrégation, not the research M2 previously implied by the directory title. Entry is by dossier after mathematics M1/equivalent; Lyon 1 M1 progression has its stated entitlement. No GRE requirement is claimed.','The linked M2 applies through e-candidat, but the page does not give the next 2027 campaign dates. M1 and M2 admissions must be distinguished; agrégation exam registration is a separate process.'],
 ['universite-de-strasbourg-fundamental-mathematics','https://mathinfo.unistra.fr/formations/master/master-mathematiques-et-applications/odf-parcours-mathematiques-fondamentales-PR439-18099/','M1 expects licence-level algebra, real/complex analysis, measure theory, topology and probability; M2 dossier must explain fit with the upcoming year’s research theme. The programme is taught in French. Optional Mobil’ITI support additionally requires the separate IRMIA++ DU.','M1/M2 applications depend on Mon Master/e-candidat/Études en France eligibility. The IRMIA++ graduate-scholarship call closes April 30, 2026 in the reviewed notice; this is historical and is not a 2027 degree deadline.'],
 ['universite-de-toulouse-mathematics-research-and-innovation','https://formations.univ-toulouse.fr/fr/les-formations/master-lmd-XB/mathematiques-et-applications-IY5KO1R2/master-parcours-research-and-innovation-ri-FIN_5351.html','The research/innovation mathematics master builds on licence/bachelor mathematics and the appropriate M1-stage preparation for M2. The official catalogue describes academic and applied research training; scholarship selection does not itself confer degree enrollment. Exact language-certificate and interview rules must be confirmed for the selected route.','The official current catalogue replaces the former inaccessible preproduction programme link. MINT’s funding information is for 2026/27; an exact 2027/28 degree/funding submission calendar has not been established. Campus France procedures can have separate residence-specific deadlines.'],
 ['universite-de-bordeaux-algebra-geometry-and-number-theory','https://math-interactions.u-bordeaux.fr/nos-formations/masters/master-mathematiques-et-applications/algebre-geometrie-et-theorie-des-nombres','The AGTN M1 develops mathematical foundations before specialized research M2. Qualifying prior-stage mathematics and track fit are assessed; the university’s M1 expectations describe dossier/grades/motivation review. ALGANT joint mobility is a different application, not an automatically funded ordinary Bordeaux place.','The university M1 admissions page still gives the 2026 calendar; direct M2 uses its own application route. No 2027 AGTN application deadline or current-open status is inferred.'],
 ['nantes-universite-mathematics-and-applications','https://sciences-techniques.univ-nantes.fr/formations/masters/master-mathematiques-et-applications','The fundamental research and agrégation routes share an initial mathematical foundation but diverge at M2. A mathematics licence/equivalent is the preparation stated for the master. Track-specific dossier/language requirements remain subject to the actual admission notice.','The faculty directs applicants to its candidature/registration page; the programme page supplies 2026 brochures, not a confirmed 2027 application call. Mon Master, Études en France and direct M2 application calendars cannot be treated as one universal deadline.'],
 ['universite-de-montpellier-fundamental-mathematics','https://maths-fds.edu.umontpellier.fr/master/maths-fonda/','The fundamental route normally follows a mathematics licence/equivalent; mathematics-intensive foreign/engineering qualifications may be assessed. A licence professionnelle does not give direct entry. M2 fundamental and M2 agrégation are distinct continuations.','The faculty’s dated 2026/27 M2 notice gives April 15–June 15, 2026 for fundamental mathematics; these dates are historical. A 2027 campaign is not inferred from the old notice.']
];
