amend('universite-psl-mathematics-and-applications','fundingDetail',['The PSL Mathematics Graduate Program’s 2026/27 spring call offers EUR 1,200/month for ten months; a second year requires conditions and a renewed application. National and international candidates may compete in the named participating master tracks. This is a historical specific call, not guaranteed funding or a current 2027/28 offer.','https://static.psl.eu/sites/default/files/2025-12/MATHEMATICS_GRADUATE_PROGRAM-Spring_call_2026%20%28flyer%29v3.pdf','Historical','2026/27 spring call'],{funding:'Competitive scholarship — next call unverified'});
const lebesgue='https://ssh.lebesgue.fr/en/content/bourses_master';
for(const id of ['universite-de-rennes-fundamental-mathematics','nantes-universite-mathematics-and-applications'])amend(id,'fundingDetail',['Henri Lebesgue Centre’s official scholarship page explicitly says it cannot offer new master scholarships for 2026/27. Its former EUR 10,000/year scheme must not be advertised as currently available. No new 2027/28 award has been established; independent funding options need individual checking. Official indexed text was reviewed because direct retrieval was unavailable.',lebesgue,'Partially verified','2026/27 new awards unavailable; 2027/28 unverified'],{funding:'Current scholarship call unavailable'});
amend('universite-grenoble-alpes-fundamental-mathematics','fundingDetail',['The 2026/27 UGA IDEX call offers EUR 9,000 for M1 or EUR 5,500 for M2 for selected eligible international candidates. It is for one academic year; a second year requires a new competition. It does not waive tuition, not every programme awards it, and installments require enrollment/attendance/examinations. It is not an automatic award or a published 2027/28 package.','https://international.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/actualites/a-la-une/appels-a-candidatures-bourses-de-master-idex-pour-l-annee-universitaire-2026-2027-1545489.kjsp?RH=1609859291874','Historical','2026/27 IDEX call'],{funding:'Competitive scholarship — next call unverified'});
amend('universite-de-strasbourg-fundamental-mathematics','fundingDetail',['IRMIA++ Mobil’ITI requires both an eligible partner master and its additional DU. Published support includes EUR 700/month for ten months plus distance/status-dependent travel/moving allowances, totaling EUR 7,000–9,500/year; tuition/DU fees are not covered. Funding is conditional and incompatible with specified other schemes. The page still quotes 2025/26 fees and the 2026 application notice, so exact 2027 funding terms must be confirmed.','https://irmiapp.unistra.fr/training/master-grant/','Partially verified','Standing scheme with historical 2025/26 fee references'],{funding:'Competitive scholarship — detailed call unverified'});
amend('universite-de-toulouse-mathematics-research-and-innovation','fundingDetail',['EUR-MINT offers excellence-selected M1 (ESR/MApI3) and M2 (RI/MApI3) doctoral-pathway bursaries to French and international applicants. The master/PhD pathway can extend up to five years, but progression, each award and any doctorate employment are separate decisions. The reviewed page does not establish the next call’s amount, duration of a particular award or exact 2027 deadline.','https://mint.math.univ-toulouse.fr/fr/comment-postuler/','Partially verified','2026/27 programme information; exact next award unverified'],{funding:'Competitive scholarship — detailed call unverified',url:'https://formations.univ-toulouse.fr/fr/les-formations/master-lmd-XB/mathematiques-et-applications-IY5KO1R2/master-parcours-research-and-innovation-ri-FIN_5351.html'});
amend('universite-de-bordeaux-algebra-geometry-and-number-theory','fundingDetail',['Bordeaux’s Eiffel nomination route includes mathematics/digital disciplines, but the university says the 2026-entry competition is closed. Applicants must follow the next university internal nomination process, not submit a personal direct application to Campus France. No current AGTN funding offer or 2027 internal cutoff is established.','https://www.u-bordeaux.fr/International/venir-bordeaux/etudiants-internationaux/programme-bourses-eiffel','Partially verified','2026 entry closed; next internal call unverified'],{funding:'Competitive scholarship — detailed call unverified'});
